  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_01:1_5_018_01:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_01:1_5_018_01:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_01:1_5_018_01:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_01:1_5_018_01:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29d93830c5caa9a0194cc5540a0eff12528452e1da2369097f2852c54a6de875",
      "text": "在广播节目中宣传歌曲的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_01:1_5_018_01:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3289fe33a272bf3f224cfa0ceacc10639ed8d72a90c4b0d7cfc71dac29177939",
      "text": "刚才广播节目的碰头会，可吓了我一跳呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_01:1_5_018_01:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7ac7c0bf27d9eaeb7aaa695ee41ff5f60e758c4d7db7696414c83a56f75e11d",
      "text": "没想到主持人居然是翔真先生的\n熟人，还真是有够巧的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_01:1_5_018_01:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a085517f4b9ee0be4755c9e9729cd2ab73b3bb2216663e47bb27bb1175683cf",
      "text": "可不是嘛。不仅艺名变了，\n气质也大变样，我完全没认出来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_01:1_5_018_01:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45bf2e3e1b304607397926c5896ed244d994c785ae3466a29b6f80f804178255",
      "text": "话说回来，那位也对翔真先生成为了\n偶像这件事感到很惊讶呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_01:1_5_018_01:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93506868f9d66bd5c9d64dcc85c9540297817e7d4c6e8befbd6099a6e406acb4",
      "text": "看到我为了提前拍摄而穿的这身服装，\n他也惊讶地直说毫无违和感对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_01:1_5_018_01:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc86ff5bcfc714f7a9c8aa52415091bea3a3d747c9ac581d7877b491139fba78",
      "text": "要不要拿这个当话茬，稍微逗逗他呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_01:1_5_018_01:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c0dce9c89bc83081f70b6178b16089e0e2331b47db19ed0af3919967b35d9b9",
      "text": "感觉广播录制时会聊得很投机呢。\n请尽情享受这份工作吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_01:1_5_018_01:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cdf6a8eb1b757721a15ce88fc51d2334dadc1bfe348d3c212a84813c90043e8",
      "text": "嗯，谢谢你。不仅要好好聊聊往事，\n我也会把新歌宣传到位的。包在我身上吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_01:1_5_018_01:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e18ea2e5910182ade5f0e948aa9e9a5dd530fa07935e336ea3b99714ae8a8069",
      "text": "好的。具体内容就全交由翔真先生发挥了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_01:1_5_018_01:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b95cb497205a053f6a791e8d07f1cd34ec544539dfecfe148508cf96b1cd4112",
      "text": "……哎呀，叫我了呢。那么，\n我就去向大家介绍这首歌的妙处啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
